From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 10:14:17 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: Add read-only MAX77779 fuel gauge

Expose retained-model capacity, voltage and charge readings without
programming a battery model, NVM or charger. Reject a reset, loading or
not-ready gauge and keep the register interface read-only. External power
and charging state remain unknown until their hardware has a driver.

Leave temperature out. Google's driver substitutes 22 C on firmware
revision 1 with subrevision below 15; this driver has no firmware revision
check or independent retail temperature qualification. Neither the
property list nor the read-only register table exposes TEMP, so it does
not create a battery thermal zone or provide charger thermal protection.

Use Google's GPL register definitions and units, with the sense resistor
in micro-ohms. Check the u64 charge conversion against INT_MAX before
assigning the signed power-supply value: raw 65535 with a permitted
100 micro-ohm resistor is 3276750000 uAh and would otherwise turn negative.
Queue periodic notifications on the freezable workqueue for system suspend.

The exact source passed a manual load, two reads 31.11 seconds apart,
unload and installed-module restoration on tegu running
7.3.0-rc6-omamobile-tegu-g7e457a96fc45. The retained firmware model reported
93%, 4.340390 V and 4720/5045/5120 mAh remaining/full/design at 2000 micro-ohms,
with presence set and no TEMP attribute. Fresh root/guard, six protected
checksums and five B payload hashes passed. Charging, current direction,
firmware temperature equivalence and suspend remain unqualified.

Exact-source host tests cover physical unit anchors, the signed boundary,
983040 charge cases, I/O errors, absence and readiness with a mocked regmap;
they do not substitute for hardware qualification of those other paths.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/bms/+/183509aff980610401869deca9f6ce8836980fe7/max77779_fg.c
Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/bms/+/183509aff980610401869deca9f6ce8836980fe7/maxfg_common.h
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
